  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e7d0d0527cba53b2fd1/step-e5ed2b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e7d0d0527cba53b2fd1/step-40bd5110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add satay seasoning and garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in Asian greens, coconut milk, the soy sauce, vinegar and a splash of water until wilted and combined, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e7d0d0527cba53b2fd1/step-5dd19d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide rice and coconut satay tofu curry between bowls to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85e7d0d0527cba53b2fd1/step-4cc99930.jpg"
    }
  ]
